Package: cinminai-libreoffice
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Brickmii/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: libreoffice-core, python3-uno, python3-gi, gir1.2-glib-2.0
Recommends: cinminai-daemon (= @VERSION@)
Description: Cin-MinAI assistant in LibreOffice
 An Assistant menu in Writer, Calc and Impress. Share a document with the
 Cin-MinAI assistant from that menu, and it can read it and suggest edits:
 every edit is shown first and only made when you click Apply, and one Ctrl+Z
 undoes it. The assistant never saves, overwrites or closes your files, and it
 sees only the documents you shared.
